	(descr "Two solder pads for permanently attaching a LiPo cell's flying leads, plus two NPTH strain-relief holes to thread the wires through before soldering. NOT a connector and NOT assembled by JLCPCB: the cell is hand-soldered after the board arrives. Pad 1 = BAT+, pad 2 = BAT-. Sized for 28-30 AWG pigtail wire.")
